---
// GuaranteeSection.astro - The USRad Guarantee with 3 cards
---

<!-- Enhanced USRad Guarantee Section -->
<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        The USRad Guarantee
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-600">
        Simple promises. No fine print.
      </p>
      <div
        class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-50 rounded-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 sm:py-3"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-4 sm:w-5 h-4 sm:h-5 text-blue-600"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
        >
          <path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-blue-700 font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm"
          >Backed by our AnciCare track record</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto"
    >
      <!-- 10 Day Payment -->
      <div class="text-center group" data-aos="zoom-in">
        <div
          class="w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 mx-auto mb-4 sm:mb-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#FFF8DC] to-[#FFE4B5] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md relative"
        >
          <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#cc9933]">10</span>
          <div
            class="absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 bg-green-500 text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-bold"
          >
            ✓
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 sm:mb-2">
          Business Days
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 px-2 sm:px-0">
          From fulfillment — direct deposit, every time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Zero Billing -->
      <div class="text-center group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div
          class="w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 mx-auto mb-4 sm:mb-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md relative"
        >
          <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-green-600">$0</span>
          <div
            class="absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 bg-green-500 text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-bold"
          >
            ✓
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 sm:mb-2">
          Billing Hassles
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 px-2 sm:px-0">
          We handle everything.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- No Setup Cost -->
      <div class="text-center group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div
          class="w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 mx-auto mb-4 sm:mb-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#FFF8DC] to-[#FFE4B5] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 shadow-md relative"
        >
          <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#cc9933]">$0</span>
          <div
            class="absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 bg-green-500 text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-bold"
          >
            ✓
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 sm:mb-2">
          Setup Costs
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 px-2 sm:px-0">
          Join free. No hidden fees.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Why These Guarantees Matter -->
    <div
      class="text-center mt-12 sm:mt-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-0"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-delay="400"
    >
      <div
        class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-blue-200 relative overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 sm:w-32 h-24 sm:h-32 bg-blue-100 rounded-full -mr-12 sm:-mr-16 -mt-12 sm:-mt-16 opacity-50"
        >
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#003087] mb-3">
            Why These Guarantees Matter
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            The same founding team previously built and operated the AnciCare
            network, building a network of 1,200+ imaging centers and paying
            more than $60 million to imaging centers from 1994 through 2001.
          </p>
          <div
            class="mt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm"
          >
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-blue-700 justify-center"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              Proven track record
            </span>
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-blue-700 justify-center"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              Same founding team
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
